			<span class='quest_body_rewserver'>Награда на серверах: шахтерский, боевой, экономический, тактический</span><span class='quest_body_reward'><span class='game-res-str'><span class='game-res-str'><span class='game-res-str'>Мгновенно создает  <span style='color:green;font-weight:bold;'>3000 <img src='/wp-content/assets/shared/icons/resources/wood.png' /></span> <span style='color:green;font-weight:bold;'>1000 <img src='/wp-content/assets/shared/icons/resources/stone.png' /></span> <span style='color:green;font-weight:bold;'>3000 <img src='/wp-content/assets/shared/icons/resources/gold.png' /></span>  </span></span></span><br></span>
