uest_header_server q_button' data-action='quest-state' quest-state='fail'><i class='fa fa-times fa-2x'></i></span><span class='quest_header_server q_button' data-action='quest-state' quest-state='noqu'><i class='fa fa-ban fa-2x'></i></span><span class='quest_header_server q_button' data-action='quest-state' quest-state='clear'><i class='fa fa-history fa-2x'></i></span>
